      "text": "Cooking is hard b/c there’s lots of irreversible steps (chemical rxns). Perfection requires trial &amp; error.\n\nWhen coding is easy (single developer), it’s b/c you can reverse your decisions easily.\n\nWhen coding is hard (abstraction design w/teams), it’s b/c of irreversible steps.",
      "url": "https://x.com/alexandr_wang/status/1256700291501572097"
    },
