      "text": "Assuming people are engaged (big assumption), large group (&gt;5 people) Zoom meetings with a live chatroom are MORE efficient than large in-person meetings.\n\nI'm curious if anyone has implemented live chat into their in-person meetings, but it is a meaningful bandwidth improvement.",
